{
  "bookId": "activity-extra-chunjie",
  "id": "source-17304",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "17304001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "春节已过，今天又是另外一个有趣的日子到来了呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17304002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "不知道主人情人节有什么安排呢，有没有兴趣看我进行一场华丽的魔术表演。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17304003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "绝对会让你大吃一惊的哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17304004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "就像是看到之前那装扮一样吃惊吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17304005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "唔唔唔！！……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17304006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "哼……还真是恶趣味的主人呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17304007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "不过如果你想的话……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17304008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "魔术表演有什么好看的，主人肯定准备今天继续陪彩音玩一天游戏吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17304009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "彩音不是才玩了整整一天吗QAQ",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17304010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "要不今天还是优纪来安排一些其他有趣的事情？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17304011",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "一阵敲门声响起。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17304012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "这是有人来拜年了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17304013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这个时候吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17304014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "我去开门。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17304015",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "不久后，绯野原爱带着换上崭新装扮的周瑜走了进来。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17304016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "咦咦，竟然是都督！？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17304017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "你怎么会过来了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17304018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "周瑜·约会时刻",
          "text": "逢此佳节，自是有约相邀。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17304019",
          "sourceType": 7,
          "text": "周瑜 · 约会时刻\n商品名称：周瑜·约会时刻Ver.\n作品名称：《赤炎·境界》\n制造商：GALATEA 伽拉\n手办材质：ABS&PVC 涂装完成\n手办规格：1/7比例模型·附专用底座・全高约273mm",
          "title": "角色介绍卡",
          "type": "profile"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17304020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "都督是来找人的吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17304021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "周瑜·约会时刻",
          "text": "自是为主公而来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17304022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "主公……唔！你指的就是主人吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17304023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "！！唔，这个家伙，总感觉到，有不对劲的气息。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17304024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "这家伙竟然也是盯着主人来的吗？可恶……看来今天的游戏计划，要受到阻碍了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17304025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "周瑜·约会时刻",
          "text": "虽未及上巳，却也可引流引觞，递成曲水，故此相邀，望与主公共享流觞曲水之雅致。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17304026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "周瑜·约会时刻",
          "text": "此举亦可祓除祸灾，祈降吉福。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17304027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "？？？为什么我完全听不懂再说什么。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17304028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "彩音也是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17304029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "虽然我也没太明白，但是……都督是来邀请我一同游玩的吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17304030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "周瑜·约会时刻",
          "text": "不知主公意下如何？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17304031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这倒是没问题……不过都督为何独来找我？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17304032",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "周瑜·约会时刻",
          "text": "积石如玉，列松如翠。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17304033",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "周瑜·约会时刻",
          "text": "郎艳独绝，世无其二。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17304034",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "周瑜·约会时刻",
          "text": "所谓曲高和寡，吾寻遍知音，仅主公一人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17304035",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "简单来说……就是周瑜没有其他朋友，只能来找主人排解寂寞了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17304036",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "周瑜·约会时刻",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17304037",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17304038",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "哈哈，既然都督盛情相邀，我哪有拒绝的道理，那么大家就一起吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
